      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Qwen-Image 2.1 (uncensored) text to image with a LoRA\n\nPick the LoRA on **Load LoRA**. The Space's defaults:\n\n| LoRA | strength | steps | prompt |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Qwen2.1_Anime_consistency | 0.7 | 28 | e.g. \"highly detailed anime illustration, consistent character, vibrant colors, expressive eyes\" |\n| qwen-image-2.1-fix-1.0-comfy (quality fix) | 1.0 | 28 | any |\n| NSFW Qwen by TheseAlpacas V2 | 0.9 | 28 | any |\n| qwen-image-2.1_penis_coachbate_preview1 | 1.0 | 28 | any |\n\nViggle Turbo is in *qwen-image-2.1-t2i-turbo*.\n\n- **cfg** stays 1: the negative prompt is ignored at 1, and raising cfg doubles the time per step.\n- **Size**: ~1 MP is fastest (1024x1024: ~66 s at 25 steps, ~105 s at 40). Native 2K works but takes ~10 min at 40 steps. Use multiples of 32.\n- Images are saved without the prompt or workflow embedded."
      ],
      "title": "Notes",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
